  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.75 cup brown sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "2 eggs, beaten",
    "2.3333332538605 cups mashed overripe bananas"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9x5-inch loaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ob3CnHnJ4dGfr16X2TiMYclokMc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20144-banana-banana-bread-VAT-016-step-01-264370503a9c4031bb4515c3e79ffb89.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20144/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, baking soda, and salt in a large bowl. Beat brown sugar and butter with an electric mixer in a separate large bowl until smooth. Stir in eggs and mashed bananas until well blended. Stir banana mixture into flour mixture until just combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tRWMaL5y8Ttzso7mV48oIlsm6hQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20144-banana-banana-bread-VAT-017-step-02-97801d682d8b455f975aae6dec856837.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20144/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour batter into the prepared loaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KA7Snkx0dEd9tKo8sKlWZBRpMvY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20144-banana-banana-bread-VAT-018-step-03-c14df521f62848dbabccb19d8c232a2e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20144/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 60 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Dk3RKD2UZ1q4BmYeMxqFFinbnAw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20144-banana-banana-bread-VAT-019-step-04-971aa588a15644d0a836a267ba205216.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20144/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let bread cool in pan for 10 minutes, then turn out onto a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hzmgq7xuWSOJgVyTHVo-50AI2Js=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20144-banana-banana-bread-VAT-020-step-05-25918e9fd077418ab2eb854c67ec8ac2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20144/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
